# notices (notices(4), D117): the slips apps post to /svc/notices, each
# client its own tree so a notice names its app, and the drawer, the
# history of notices and of the clipboard. It hears each entry committed
# on Radharc's `clipboard` and keeps it in /data/Clips, when there is a
# volume.
service notices
program notices
export per-client
use windows
grant windows clipboard
mount /data fs/volume optional
mount /lib/fonts bootfs/lib/fonts
restart on-failure
